1
00:06:37,500 --> 00:06:43,500
You didn't think this was the end of the story, did you?

2
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:21,000
Descendants 3 is a family, tv movie, adventure film directed by Kenny Ortega.

3
00:19:52,500 --> 00:19:58,500
The teenagers of Disney's most infamous villains return to the Isle of the Lost to
recruit a new batch of villainous offspring to join them at Auradon Prep.

4
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:36,000
Mal, played by Dove Cameron.

5
00:33:07,500 --> 00:33:13,500
Ben, played by Mitchell Hope.

6
00:39:45,000 --> 00:39:51,000
Carlos, played by Cameron Boyce.

7
00:46:22,500 --> 00:46:28,500
Evie, played by Sofia Carson.

8
00:53:00,000 --> 00:53:06,000
Harry Hook, played by Thomas Doherty.

9
00:59:37,500 --> 00:59:43,500
Chad, played by Jedidiah Goodacre.

10
01:06:15,000 --> 01:06:21,000
Descendants 3 is an American musical fantasy television film directed by
Kenny Ortega, and written by Sara Parriott and Josann McGibbon.

11
01:12:52,500 --> 01:12:58,500
It is a sequel to Descendants 2 (2017), and the third installment in the Descendants
franchise, while being the last film focused on Mal (Dove Cameron) and her friends.

12
01:19:30,000 --> 01:19:36,000
It also stars Cameron Boyce, Sofia Carson, Booboo Stewart,
Cheyenne Jackson, China Anne McClain, and Sarah Jeffery.

13
01:26:07,500 --> 01:26:13,500
The film premiered on Disney Channel on August 2, 2019, and in other
territories worldwide starting on October 12, 2019.

14
01:32:45,000 --> 01:32:51,000
It was followed by an animated television special, Descendants: The Royal Wedding, released in 2021, while
a fourth film focusing on new characters, Descendants: The Rise of Red, premiered in 2024.

15
01:39:22,500 --> 01:39:28,500
The film explores themes of magic, musical, family.
